{
    "background_story": "Luz grew up in a poverty-stricken neighborhood where every day was a struggle to survive. With no formal education, she was forced to find ways to make ends meet from a young age. She began as a ragpicker, scouring the streets for discarded materials to sell or repurpose. Despite the hardships, Luz's determination and resourcefulness turned her ragpicking business into a thriving enterprise. She formed a cooperative with other local ragpickers, creating a network that helped them access better markets and fairer prices. As Luz's business grew, so did her impact on the community. She became a leader and advocate for the rights of waste workers, fighting for better working conditions and social recognition. Luz's story is a testament to the resilience and ingenuity of those who turn scraps into opportunities.",
